hi,

the old patch still had a few problems with the ramdac and dotclock
settings. with the new patch i can also run resolutions above 800x600.
(in retrospect, i must have been very lucky to get a screen on the
previous patch without a panic).

users of other tga cards will only benefit of the increased console
screen, which isn't fixed to 80x34 anymore.

enjoy,
--nils


